{"id":81439468615186,"name":"Build to Become Sniper","desc":"🧱 Build stairs to the sniper tower.\n💥 Use RPG to destroy other players bridges.\n🏃 Dodge the sniper's bullets.\n⚔️ Buy gears to protect yourself from the sniper.\n🏆 Reach the end and become sniper.","path":"/game/81439468615186-build-to-become-sniper","slug":"81439468615186-build-to-become-sniper","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d775b32da90e1e75bd2c01db296d297ac35611a6deac757b566f8abb0f65c5e9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63dd225945eaa0f30c8f3605da5358e4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":11060838,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-25T05:59:27.402Z","creator":{"name":"Brain Trip Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69c379bfd1773619a8a063ce","title":"Basically Silentaim","game":{"_id":"69c379bfd1773619a8a063cb","gameId":81439468615186,"name":"Build to Become Sniper","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"81439468615186-build-to-become-sniper","path":"/game/81439468615186-build-to-become-sniper","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":81439468615186},"slug":"Build-to-Become-Sniper-Basically-Silentaim-148324","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3161,"executes":627,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4cdea521766936b92155439e23cb977616ce8f5db147df64342e0263e5936a75.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-8375e486e293a3e15be5c1b96c895643-ef23fcdf3cfc.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-8375e486e293a3e15be5c1b96c895643-ef23fcdf3cfc.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4cdea521766936b92155439e23cb977616ce8f5db147df64342e0263e5936a75.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-8375e486e293a3e15be5c1b96c895643-ef23fcdf3cfc.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-8375e486e293a3e15be5c1b96c895643-ef23fcdf3cfc.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-25T05:59:27.403Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-25T05:59:27.403Z","lastBump":"2026-03-25T05:59:27.403Z","script":"-- I didn't make a loop for this since its opensourced, so you can either wrap it in a loop or don't.\nlocal ebt = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal idk = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal you = ebt.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal prediction = 3 -- Increase this to change distance shots, without perdiction its hard to get kills on moving targets\n-- I cant talk today sorry its like 2 am and tired my grammar is hanging by a thread\n\nlocal youusetocallmeonmycellphone = {}\nfor _, player in ipairs(ebt:GetPlayers()) do\n    if player ~= you and player.Character and player.Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\") then\n        table.insert(youusetocallmeonmycellphone, player)\n    end\nend\n\nif #youusetocallmeonmycellphone > 0 then\n    local randomTarget = youusetocallmeonmycellphone[math.random(1, #youusetocallmeonmycellphone)]\n    local char = randomTarget.Character\n    local hrp = char.HumanoidRootPart\n    local humanoid = char:FindFirstChild(\"Humanoid\")\n    \n    local targetPos = hrp.Position\n        if humanoid and humanoid.MoveDirection.Magnitude > 0 then\n        targetPos = targetPos + (humanoid.MoveDirection * prediction)\n    end\n    local Event = idk.Functions.RemoteFunctions.SniperShoot\n        Event:InvokeServer(\n        targetPos,\n        Vector3.new(0, -1, 0), \n        0\n    )\nelse\n    return\nend","features":"() Opensource - credit if you use this script\nHas movement prediction support to help kill randos - customizable distance\nRandomly selects a player and attempts to shoot them","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"665152598dd22f2885e42ceb","username":"mcdaggitt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media